      (∀ i, ContDiff ℝ ∞ (K i) ∧ tsupport (K i) ⊆ Metric.closedBall 0 ε) ∧
      ∀ x, f x = ∑ i, ∫ t, K i t * F i (h.revProdExp X t * x)
